# Bullet delegate key: hex-encoded 32-byte ed25519 seed.
# Generate with: go run ./cmd/perps-bench accounts generate --venues bullet --out .env.bullet.local
# Register the printed public key as a delegate at app.bullet.xyz.
BULLET_DELEGATE_PRIVATE_KEY=
# Main Bullet account address from the webapp. Reads and the user.orders
# topic key on this address, not the delegate address.
BULLET_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS=
# There is no env var for the REST/WebSocket host: no code reads
# BULLET_BASE_URL or BULLET_WS_URL. To validate against testnet, run with
# examples/bullet-testnet-builder.json, which points the order-submission
# socket, the confirmation feed, and the signing chain params at testnet all
# at once (see internal/venues/bullet/README.md).
